ction" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-21_"><div class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-20_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-14_ pf-bg-lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/0258/1235/files/781_1223_1_320x.jpg?v=1756475417" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/0258/1235/files/781_1223_1.jpg?v=1756475417 1536w" width="2362" height="1890" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="781_1223_1.jpg__PID:81699402-1ed8-4518-bfaa-a95de14e59d4" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cTTcKX gslXuF pf-13_"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-19_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLLNPL gTJAOY pf-16_">Global Racing Credibility</h3><p class="sc-fPrdjK gxzXqc pf-18_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Redlined Motorsport</b> has built a large global customer base with over <b>50 race cars</b> competing in more than <b>20 countries worldwide</b>.<br><br>Every vehicle is designed and built in-house from scratch at our Johannesburg facility.<br><br>We provide <b>comprehensive driver, navigation, and technical training</b> for Rally Raid racing – ensuring international competitiveness.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-6645" data-category="Brand Story" data-name="Clover" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-185_"><div class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-184_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-181_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLLNPL gTJAOY pf-178_">Technical Excellence in SA</h3><p class="sc-fPrdjK gxz